ons + labs can often provide a faster route into infrastructure careers."},{"type":"table","header":["PG pathway","Career value"],"rows":[[{"text":"MCA"},{"text":"Broad technical advancement"}],[{"text":"M.Sc. Computer Science"},{"text":"Computing foundation"}],[{"text":"M.Sc. Cloud Computing"},{"text":"Cloud specialisation"}],[{"text":"M.Tech Cloud Computing"},{"text":"Advanced cloud"}],[{"text":"M.Tech Computer Networks"},{"text":"Networking"}],[{"text":"M.Sc. Cybersecurity"},{"text":"Security"}],[{"text":"MBA IT"},{"text":"IT management"}],[{"text":"M.Sc. DevOps / Infrastructure"},{"text":"Infrastructure specialisation"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended route"},{"type":"h","text":"BCA Cloud/DevOps"},{"type":"flow","items":["System Administrator","Cloud Administrator","Cloud/Infrastructure Engineer","DevOps/SRE","Cloud Architect"]}]},{"heading":"Study abroad","kind":"abroad","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Country","Strong areas"],"rows":[[{"text":"🇨🇦 Canada"},{"text":"Cloud, infrastructure, cybersecurity"}],[{"text":"🇺🇸 USA"},{"text":"Cloud, DevOps, SRE"}],[{"text":"🇬🇧 UK"},{"text":"Cloud computing and infrastructure"}],[{"text":"🇩🇪 Germany"},{"text":"Infrastructure and systems engineering"}],[{"text":"🇮🇪 Ireland"},{"text":"Cloud and enterprise technology"}],[{"text":"🇳🇱 Netherlands"},{"text":"Cloud and distributed systems"}],[{"text":"🇦🇺 Australia"},{"text":"Cloud and cybersecurity"}],[{"text":"🇸🇬 Singapore"},{"text":"Enterprise infrastructure and cloud"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Useful master's areas"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Cloud Computing"},{"text":"Computer Science"},{"text":"Information Technology"},{"text":"Distributed Systems"},{"text":"Cybersecurity"},{"text":"Network Engineering"},{"text":"DevOps"},{"text":"Software Systems"},{"text":"Information Systems"}]}]},{"heading":"Career progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Infrastructure pathway"},{"type":"h","text":"BCA Cloud/DevOps"},{"type":"h","text":"Junior System Admin