:"Root-cause analysis"},{"text":"Capacity forecasting"},{"text":"Automated remediation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"But engineers still need strong fundamentals to verify automated actions."},{"type":"h","text":"4. Cloud Security"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"IAM"},{"text":"Zero Trust"},{"text":"Secrets management"},{"text":"Network security"},{"text":"Vulnerability management"},{"text":"Security monitoring"},{"text":"Cloud compliance"}]},{"type":"p","text":"This creates a strong bridge between infrastructure and cybersecurity."},{"type":"h","text":"5. Edge + Distributed Infrastructure"},{"type":"p","text":"Future infrastructure will increasingly span:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Cloud"},{"text":"Data centres"},{"text":"Edge devices"},{"text":"IoT"},{"text":"5G networks"},{"text":"Hybrid environments"}]},{"type":"p","text":"This increases demand for professionals who understand distributed systems and networking."},{"type":"note","label":"2040–2046","text":"How the role evolves"},{"type":"p","text":"The traditional model:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Install server","configure server","fix server"]},{"type":"p","text":"will increasingly become:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Define infrastructure","provision through code","monitor automatically","detect anomalies","remediate","optimise cost and reliability"]},{"type":"p","text":"The highest-value infrastructure professionals will therefore combine:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Linux","cloud","networking","automation","security","observability","architecture."],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended final skill stack"},{"type":"h","text":"Operating systems"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Linux"},{"text":"Windows Server"},{"text":"Active Directory"},{"text":"PowerShell"},{"text":"Bash"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Networking"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"TCP/IP"},{"text":"DNS"},{"text":"DHCP"},{"text":"Routing"},{"text":"Switching"},{"text":"VLAN"},{"text":"VPN"},{"text":"Firewalls"},